# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the op-fusion programme's four-card window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/fusion-1 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-fusion-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# CCLL2 (TIMED, CCL options, WP5): the LEVER again (B2); eight live (concurrent8_steady) in the repeat pair of the ABAB, every boot a fresh reset. READ: c2_smoke_check
# clean (a lever arm also has its engaged line and no fell-back line), no stall; then PAIRED per round, never by unpaired medians: python3 scripts/ci/w2ln_timing_compare.py
# pair <A container log> <B container log> --window steady --a-smoke <A smoke log> --b-smoke <B smoke log> for (CCLC1, CCLL1) and (CCLC2, CCLL2), and its floor subcommand
# over the two control logs; the texts equal (text_mismatches empty). the reduce-scatter winner of the P0 quick sweep on four cards (FABRIC_1D, payload 4352, image
# tp4-octo2-1): chunks_per_sync=1 on the 128 unit-major reduce-scatters a pass cut the in-trace call from 16.87 to 14.74 us (-2.14 us, 5 of 5 paired rounds, A/A noise 0.08
# us) with the input in DRAM and in L1, and was bit-exact against the sequential engine's own one-tile call. The model passes 10, more than a worker has chunks, so every
# iteration signalled once at its end; 1 lets the receiver start reducing the first chunk while the next is in flight. Exact by construction (the ring's chunk parity is a
# function of the tile index, not of the sync cadence). A reduce-scatter-only set leaves DistributedNorm.forward unwrapped. It needs QWEN_FAST_TP4_RS_UNIT_MAJOR=1, which
# the production profile sets. Duration (estimate): 35 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-ccl
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady
